    "annotations" : {
      "definition" : [ {
        "identifier" : "definition",
        "language" : "en",
        "value" : "Within the scope of this application profile, any SKOS concept can serve as a warrant for editorial decision making (e.g., a concept in an external vocabulary such as Homosaurus supporting a label change). Warrant-hood is acquired by role: a concept used as the object of ProvKOS:wasWarrantedBy or ProvKOS:cite is inferred to be a ProvKOS:Warrant via those properties' ranges; other concepts are unaffected.",
